WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
We would like to ask you a few questions. First one:

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Why did you choose us?

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Because I found you on Facebook.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Second: what did you like about us?

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
You were so cheerful and kind, and you left everything properly tidy afterwards.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Neat and nice.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Third:

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
What do you think of the result of our work?

9
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
I’m absolutely delighted with it.

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Last one:

11
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Would you recommend us?

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
I already have, and I will keep doing it.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Thank you so much.

14
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Bye!
